# SNA Project

## Description
Project for Social Network Analysis.

## Files

- `bluesky.ipynb`: data downloading
- `metadata.ipynb`: association of token to sector
- `bluesky_sna_analysis.ipynb`: data preparation and analysis
- `bluesky_large_edges_unweighted_10000.csv`: dataset used for experiments
- `ticker_metadata.csv`: data with sector informations
## Structure

Future tasks and analyses will be organized in dedicated folders.
